INSERT INTO `sentence_bank` VALUES (75, 'en', '即便日程排得满满当当，她仍能抽出时间坚持每日冥想，这自律令人惊叹。', 'Even with a jam-packed schedule, she miraculously carves out time for daily meditation—such astonishing self-discipline.', 5, '2026-08-06 13:28:04');
